<p>Any time you deal damage with a psionic ability you incur a negative biofeedback in your foes, stacking up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> times for 5 turns.</p><p>Each stack reduces their physical save by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7,</acronym> defense and armour by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6.</acronym></p><p>This effect may only occur once per turn.</p>